# Copixi — Environment Variables
# AGENTS.md §10: Never expose GEMINI_API_KEY in frontend (no VITE_ prefix)
# This file is safe to commit. Copy to .env.local for local dev and fill secrets.

# Server-only (Vercel Environment Variables)
# Used exclusively in api/gemini.ts (Vercel Function) — never in client code
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: deployment
# VERCEL_URL is auto-injected by Vercel
